OL,3,AApple says it will replace iPhone Duo
OL,4,Ahandsets with screen problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple says it will replace iPhone Duo
OL,7,Fhandsets that have developed problems
OL,8,Fwith their screens just days after the
OL,9,Fhighly-anticipated smartphone went on
OL,10,Fsale.
OL,12,FPhotos posted on social media show
OL,13,Flines that appeared on the screens of
OL,14,Fthe technology giant's first ever
OL,15,Ffoldable device, which has a starting
OL,16,Fprice of #1,999 ($2,668) in the UK.
OL,18,FApple said it is aware of "an issue
OL,19,Fimpacting the inner display on a small
OL,20,Fnumber" of the phones and urged
OL,21,Faffected users to contact the company
OL,22,Ffor a replacement.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
